(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers electrical works for sewage treatment plant including motors) Tj T*
(and panels complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(i\) Equipment is to be rated for a maximum ambient temperature of 50° C.) Tj T*
(ii\) The relative humidity at site can go up to 95 pct.) Tj T*
(iii\) The site is located at less than 1000 metre above MSL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(i\) Distribution boards shall be of suitable dimensions for the equipment housed.) Tj T*
(ii\) The main LT switchboard shall comply with IS/IEC 61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(iii\) The switchboard shall be of floor standing cubicle construction using CRCA sheet) Tj T*
(steel 2 m.m. thick.) Tj T*
(iv\) The switchboard shall have a rated operational voltage of 415 V AC, 3 phase 4 wire,) Tj T*
(50 Hertz.) Tj T*
(v\) The main busbar shall be electrolytic grade aluminium with a continuous rating of) Tj T*
(1600 Amperes.) Tj T*
(vi\) The short time withstand current of the busbars shall be 50 kA \(rms\) for one second.) Tj T*
(vii\) The panel enclosure is to have a degree of protection of IP54.) Tj T*
(viii\) Internal separation of the switchboard shall be to Form 3b.) Tj T*
(ix\) Each incomer shall be a 1600 Amperes, four pole, motorised air circuit breaker) Tj T*
(complying with IS/IEC 60947-2:2003.) Tj T*
(x\) Outgoing feeders shall be controlled by MCCBs having an ultimate breaking capacity of) Tj T*
() Tj T*
