(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated operational voltage: 415 V AC) Tj T*
(Main busbar rated current: 1600 Amperes) Tj T*
(Rated short-time withstand current: 50 kA \(rms\) for 1 s) Tj T*
(Enclosure degree of protection: IP54) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 5: DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(i\) Squirrel cage induction motors complying with IS 325:1996 shall be supplied.) Tj T*
(ii\) Motor rated output shall be 37 k.W..) Tj T*
(iii\) Motors are to operate on 415 V AC ± 10 pct, 50 Hertz ± 5 pct, three phase supply.) Tj T*
(iv\) Motors shall meet efficiency class IE3 of IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(v\) The motor enclosure shall have IP55 degree of protection.) Tj T*
(vi\) Insulation shall be class F, with temperature rise restricted to class B, for) Tj T*
(continuous S1 duty.) Tj T*
(vii\) The motor synchronous speed shall be 1500 rev/min.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 6: LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(i\) LT power cables shall be aluminium conductor, XLPE insulated, armoured, PVC sheathed,) Tj T*
(1.1 kV grade, complying with IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(ii\) Maximum continuous conductor temperature of the cables shall be 90° C.) Tj T*
(iii\) Copper conductor control cables of 2.5 Sq mm, PVC insulated, 1.1 kV grade shall) Tj T*
(comply with IS 1554 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(iv\) Class 2 stranded conductors complying with IS 8130 shall be used.) Tj T*
(v\) Cables shall be run in RCC trenches or on perforated trays as per drawings.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 3 of 5) Tj T*
